{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 4580,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Proposed to-be enrichment\n**Symptom:** Enrichment needs repeated coordination from tier 0, and completed part reading does not by itself account for every required derived output.\n**Root cause:** The run needs one accountable Lead, separate completion evidence for reading and derivations, and independent judgement with bounded repair.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `proposed-tobe-enrichment.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** sets or has already authorized the enrichment goal, captured sources, required outputs, coverage and spending",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dentry",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ recorded parent invocation or standalone commissioner?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**2.** delegates the bounded enrichment to a Lead and sets its specification, including when supporting another project",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-direct",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "commissions the Lead directly and owns the run specification",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-parentbind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "binds the child to its invoking parent's authorized specification, Lead, source subset and receipt keys; no repeated Owner or tier-0 commissioning",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**3.** owns completion and plans the run from accepted components without widening the parent's mandate",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**4.** checks specification schema, pinned IDs, recorded start authority, role qualifications, grants and counters; preserves the parent's batch ledger",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dadmit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ run admitted?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-stagecontract",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Target integration: Core checks grants, counters and critical flags at every dispatch/commit. Agents own meaning. Deferred routes return queued tasks; no silent model substitution.",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-ownerstart",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "decides the missing start, sensitivity or spending authority; existing authority is not asked for again",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-radmit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "⇉ **UC-D**: resolves a mapped qualification or admission fault using an accepted remedy within scope",
      "color": "2",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Doctor"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-escalated",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 9140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "explains the unresolved issue, evidence and required intervention to tier 0 or the Owner, with completed and partial work accounted for",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-critical",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "receives critical security, data-loss or authority-boundary evidence immediately, with tier 0 when present",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-nowork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns no-source-work to the invoking parent or standalone commissioner; preserves the parent's pending decisions and original item accounting",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**5.** validate: checks source hashes, evidence, paths and compatible recipe/route receipts; applies stops and spend controls; old publication never bypasses fresh admission",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-downerstart",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ authorized?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-paused",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "explains the pause, retained work and next decision or continuation needed; submits the checkpoint notice for delivery",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-eescalated",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 14940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ the accountable actor receives the unresolved or critical enrichment failure\n*outcome: escalated*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-enowork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ no source work was admitted; the caller retains the accounted no-work result\n*outcome: reused*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dvalidate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ source validation result?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-epaused",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ the affected enrichment is paused for an explicit decision or authorized continuation\n*outcome: paused*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 2740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**6.** parse: runs scripted AST, text or PDF extraction and page mapping; retains original evidence and records extraction limits",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-itemfailed",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 10540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "records the failed stage and noncritical ticket; retains the item's completed work and leaves other frozen items runnable",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-critical_at_5709aeb668",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2640,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "receives critical security, data-loss or authority-boundary evidence immediately, with tier 0 when present",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dparse",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 2940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ scripted extraction result?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a19",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 10740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**19.** assembles the source enrichment proposal and reconciles its content, explaining gaps in reading, derivations, drafts or publication for the Oracle",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-eescalated_at_5709aeb668",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 2640,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ the accountable actor receives the unresolved or critical enrichment failure\n*outcome: escalated*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 5140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**7.** assigns bounded part-reading tasks to Scribes, keeping source description separate from the requesting project's fit judgement",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversionplan",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 2990,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "assigns needed model-assisted transcription or cleanup to a Scribe within the approved route and allowance",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dmore",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 10940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ unprocessed entries remain in the pinned source list?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 5340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**8.** reads assigned parts and returns located source-stated points, limits, term usages and candidate reasoning stances",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Scribe (tier 3)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversionwork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 3140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "transcribes or cleans the supplied material, preserves page or part anchors and explains any uncertain or missing content",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Scribe (tier 3)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a20",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 11140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**20.** judges the enrichment package against its specification: deterministic checks first, then isolated model judgement, with evidence for the verdict",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Oracle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-host",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4840,
      "y": 5540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "answers the bounded tasks through qualified role assignments and the existing task pool",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Model host"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversionreview",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 3190,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "checks available conversion against original evidence for fidelity; records uncertainty and missing material; does not attest unread pages",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dverdict",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 11340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ enrichment verdict?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Oracle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 5740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**9.** checks task schemas, literal quote locations and current-text receipt keys; counts completed parts and records queued or refused tasks",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversioncheck",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 3740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "checks returned fields, hashes and literal anchors; stores task outcomes and the Clerk's fidelity verdict with actual representation coverage",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a21",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 13340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**21.** hands back verdict, evidence, coverage, known/unknown spend and tickets; names separate owners and current states for Source and lens decisions",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-partialreport",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 11540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns partial coverage and verdict to the invoking parent or standalone commissioner, with separate Source/lens worklists, named owners and known/unknown spend",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-rwork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 11540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "⇉ **UC-D**: remedies a mapped enrichment shortfall, then returns the repair for independent Oracle recheck",
      "color": "2",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Doctor"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-scout",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 11540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "investigates an unmapped shortfall from evidence and directs bounded Scribe scouting tasks",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dreadtransport",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 5940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ recorded transport incident, critical flag or application task result?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dconversion",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 3940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ conversion task and anchor-check status?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-drecipient",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 13540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ recorded invoking parent or standalone specification owner?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-epartial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 11740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ a permitted partial enrichment is returned with its true coverage and remaining work\n*outcome: partial*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-resume",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 12140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "checks requested scope and compatible receipts; unfinished work resumes pinned inputs; finished partials need re-approval/new batch; publication gets fresh admission",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-realign",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 11740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "re-aligns within the specification using permitted actions; proposes new remedies for Owner acceptance rather than adding them itself",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 6140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**10.** proofreads the readings and directs the existing lens chain: perspective, attention, blind challenge, role, probe and synthesis",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-readoutage",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 6740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "records 429/timeout/unavailable route and bounded attempts; defers equivalent failed-route calls; retains task gaps, receipts and unpriced cost",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversiongap",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 4940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "retains returned cleanup-error partial or missing-material partial/queued status and usable raw extraction; absent content receives no reading credit",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversionfallback",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 4140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "keeps unmapped cleanup unused; restores original page-mapped text; parse may complete only when usable text and no other gap remain",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversionoutage",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 4340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "records transport code, attempts, retry-after and known/unknown cost; defers further equivalent calls on the failed route pending bounded direction",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a22",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 13940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**22.** reviews the handback once against the delegated goal without repeating the workers' tasks",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-directreport",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 13740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "receives the Lead's enrichment result and Oracle verdict directly",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-parentreturn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 13740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns the child package and verdict to the invoking parent, which owns acceptance and the final Owner or tier-0 handoff",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dresume",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 12340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ repair re-entry authorized and within the remaining allowance?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-drealign",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 11940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ does the proposed correction address the cause with evidence of progress?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 6340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**11.** reconciles the accumulated readings across the source, corroborates supported stances and resolves probes; records unfinished required derivations separately",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Clerk (tier 2)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-readroute",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 6940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ retry only pending affected tasks within the grant, keep queued gaps, or pause?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-conversionroute",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 4540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ retry affected conversion within the grant, retain fallback, or pause the affected work?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dhandback",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 14140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ handback meets the delegated goal?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-delivered",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 15340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "records handback and separate Source-acceptance/lens-review worklists with actual states and owners; neither decision is implied by enrichment",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-repairperson",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "decides the explicit re-approval or additional authority needed for the affected repair work",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dread",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 6540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ recorded part-reading and required-derivation status?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dreadretry",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4240,
      "y": 7140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ same-route pending-task retry within counters, backoff, qualification and existing authority?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
