      "y": 15140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**23.** returns the result to its active project or reports it to the Owner, with the remaining acceptance step explicit",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-tidy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 14340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns evidence for one bounded tidy-up and independent recheck; the Lead and Doctor do work, the Oracle judges",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6040,
      "y": 15540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ the enrichment specification is met; grounded outputs and the separate acceptance obligation are handed back\n*outcome: success*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
